# Culling Ritual cast on turn 3 destroys the four Moxen (mana value 0) and Bot2's Mox Sapphire and Mind Stone
# (mana value exactly 2: the limit, and an opponent's permanents count) and leaves the lands and Coalition Relic
# (mana value 3), then adds one {B} or {G} for each Mox destroyed, each chosen separately (CR 701.8a; ruling 2021-04-16:
# not limited to one color). Turn 1 puts the Moxen and the Relic out (Relic paid by Jet, Ruby and Pearl); turn 3 pays
# the Ritual with Swamp, Forest, Emerald and Ruby.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Coalition Relic
Culling Ritual
Forest
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mind Stone
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Coalition Relic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Mind Stone.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Culling Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Colors(Green; Black; Green; Green; Black; Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {B}{B}{G}{G}{G}{G}
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Forest; Coalition Relic
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Bot2.Graveyard = Mind Stone; Mox Sapphire
Bot1.Graveyard = Culling Ritual; Mox Emerald; Mox Pearl; Mox Ruby; Mox Jet
